  "identifier": "ozone-his",
  "name": "Ozone HIS",
  "description": "Open-source Health Information System distribution that integrates OpenMRS 3 (EMR/clinical records), Odoo (ERP, billing, pharmacy), SENAITE (laboratory information system), and Apache Superset (analytics) into a single deployable platform connected via FHIR. Designed for resource-limited and LMIC settings, with offline capability inherited from OpenMRS 3. Production deployments include Médecins Sans Frontières (MSF) at Mosul Hospital in Iraq, Ubuntu Village of Life rural health system in Burundi, and programmes at UCSF, World Bank, and FAIMER. Community maintained under the ozone-his organisation with discussion on the OpenMRS Slack and forum. MPL-2.0, 32 stars, v1.0.0-alpha.15.",
  "url": "https://www.ozone-his.com/",
  "codeRepository": "https://github.com/ozone-his/ozone",
  "license": "MPL-2.0",
