  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Fills a distinct niche as a batteries-included HIS distribution built on OpenMRS 3 — adding integrated billing (Odoo), lab (SENAITE), and analytics (Superset) that OpenMRS alone does not provide. Production-proven at MSF Mosul Hospital (Iraq), Burundi, UCSF, and World Bank deployments despite carrying an alpha version tag. Community-governed within the OpenMRS ecosystem, MPL-2.0. Marked Assess rather than Adopt due to alpha versioning and low community discovery (32 stars); the deployment evidence is credible but the project has not yet reached a stable 1.0 release.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-13",
